data: {"id": "4f6e25c6d7234a23-thinking-layer-221", "run_id": "4f6e25c6d7234a23", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` 的状态确认为 `Running` 但 `READY` 为 `0/1`。根据异常分类标准，这属于 `NotReady` 状态。\n\n为了确定具体的异常原因（如探针失败、配置错误等），我选择了最相关的 Runbook `pod-notready-probe-failed.md` 进行诊断，因为它专门处理 Running 但 READY 未满足的情况。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788458332459}

